{
  "description": "Casos de `rayito setup` que no llegan a crear nada (plan, --dry-run y errores tempranos), con la salida exacta. Los dos SDK los ejecutan con dobles construidos desde `input` (el mismo formato que plan-vectors.json); stdin nunca es una terminal. `stdout`/`stderr` son texto exacto; `json` se compara ya parseado. Los marcadores `{sdkVersion}` y `{cdkBucket}` se sustituyen como en plan-vectors.json.",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "dry-run en una cuenta nueva",
      "args": [
        "setup",
        "--dry-run"
      ],
      "input": {
        "region": "us-east-1",
        "account": "123456789012",
        "bucket": null,
        "environmentBucket": null,
        "artifact": null,
        "stack": null,
        "buckets": {
          "{cdkBucket}": "us-east-1"
        },
        "image": null
      },
      "expected": {
        "exitCode": 0,
        "stdout": "rayito setup: cuenta 123456789012, región us-east-1\n  bucket {cdkBucket}: reutilizar (bootstrap de CDK)\n  pila de IAM rayito-m0-iam: crear\n  imagen rayito-base: publicar desde rayd-v{sdkVersion} (≈ 10 min)\nCoste aproximado:\n  pila de IAM: gratis\n  imagen: ≈ $0,04 por semana por versión publicada (mínimo una semana)\n  zip de la imagen en el bucket: céntimos\nno se creó ni cambió nada (--dry-run)\n",
        "stderr": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "dry-run en una cuenta nueva con --json",
      "args": [
        "--json",
        "setup",
        "--dry-run"
      ],
      "input": {
        "region": "us-east-1",
        "account": "123456789012",
        "bucket": null,
        "environmentBucket": null,
        "artifact": null,
        "stack": null,
        "buckets": {
          "{cdkBucket}": "us-east-1"
        },
        "image": null
      },
      "expected": {
        "exitCode": 0,
        "json": {
          "rayito": "{sdkVersion}",
          "region": "us-east-1",
          "account": "123456789012",
          "dryRun": true,
          "ready": false,
          "steps": [
            {
              "resource": "bucket",
              "name": "{cdkBucket}",
              "action": "reuse",
              "source": "cdkBootstrap",
              "status": null,
              "imageVersion": null,
              "release": null,
              "previousBucket": null
            },
            {
              "resource": "iamStack",
              "name": "rayito-m0-iam",
              "action": "create",
              "source": null,
              "status": null,
              "imageVersion": null,
              "release": null,
              "previousBucket": null
            },
            {
              "resource": "baseImage",
              "name": "rayito-base",
              "action": "publish",
              "source": "release",
              "status": null,
              "imageVersion": null,
              "release": "rayd-v{sdkVersion}",
              "previousBucket": null
            }
          ],
          "cost": [
            "pila de IAM: gratis",
            "imagen: ≈ $0,04 por semana por versión publicada (mínimo una semana)",
            "zip de la imagen en el bucket: céntimos"
          ],
          "result": null,
          "doctor": null,
          "error": null,
          "exitCode": 0
        },
        "stderr": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "dry-run en una cuenta preparada a mano",
      "args": [
        "setup",
        "--dry-run"
      ],
      "input": {
        "region": "us-east-1",
        "account": "123456789012",
        "bucket": null,
        "environmentBucket": null,
        "artifact": null,
        "stack": {
          "status": "CREATE_COMPLETE",
          "outputs": {
            "BuildRoleArn": "arn:aws:iam::123456789012:role/rayito-m0-build-us-east-1"
          },
          "parameters": {
            "ArtifactBucket": "amzn-s3-demo-bucket"
          }
        },
        "buckets": {
          "amzn-s3-demo-bucket": "us-east-1"
        },
        "image": {
          "state": "UPDATED",
          "versions": [
            {
              "imageVersion": "1.0",
              "state": "SUCCESSFUL",
              "status": "ACTIVE",
              "createdAt": "2026-10-01T00:00:00Z"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "expected": {
        "exitCode": 0,
        "stdout": "rayito setup: cuenta 123456789012, región us-east-1\n  bucket amzn-s3-demo-bucket: reutilizar (el de la pila de IAM)\n  pila de IAM rayito-m0-iam: ya existe (CREATE_COMPLETE)\n  imagen rayito-base: ya existe (versión 1.0 lanzable)\nLa cuenta ya está preparada: no hay nada que crear.\nno se creó ni cambió nada (--dry-run)\n",
        "stderr": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "sin --yes y sin terminal",
      "args": [
        "setup"
      ],
      "input": {
        "region": "us-east-1",
        "account": "123456789012",
        "bucket": null,
        "environmentBucket": null,
        "artifact": null,
        "stack": null,
        "buckets": {
          "{cdkBucket}": "us-east-1"
        },
        "image": null
      },
      "expected": {
        "exitCode": 2,
        "stdout": "rayito setup: cuenta 123456789012, región us-east-1\n  bucket {cdkBucket}: reutilizar (bootstrap de CDK)\n  pila de IAM rayito-m0-iam: crear\n  imagen rayito-base: publicar desde rayd-v{sdkVersion} (≈ 10 min)\nCoste aproximado:\n  pila de IAM: gratis\n  imagen: ≈ $0,04 por semana por versión publicada (mínimo una semana)\n  zip de la imagen en el bucket: céntimos\n",
        "stderr": "rayito: preparar la cuenta crea recursos con coste: confírmalo con --yes (o desde una terminal)\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "sin --yes con --json",
      "args": [
        "--json",
        "setup"
      ],
      "input": {
        "region": "us-east-1",
        "account": "123456789012",
        "bucket": null,
        "environmentBucket": null,
        "artifact": null,
        "stack": null,
        "buckets": {
          "{cdkBucket}": "us-east-1"
        },
        "image": null
      },
      "expected": {
        "exitCode": 2,
        "json": {
          "rayito": "{sdkVersion}",
          "region": "us-east-1",
          "account": "123456789012",
          "dryRun": false,
          "ready": false,
          "steps": [
            {
              "resource": "bucket",
              "name": "{cdkBucket}",
              "action": "reuse",
              "source": "cdkBootstrap",
              "status": null,
              "imageVersion": null,
              "release": null,
              "previousBucket": null
            },
            {
              "resource": "iamStack",
              "name": "rayito-m0-iam",
              "action": "create",
              "source": null,
              "status": null,
              "imageVersion": null,
              "release": null,
              "previousBucket": null
            },
            {
              "resource": "baseImage",
              "name": "rayito-base",
              "action": "publish",
              "source": "release",
              "status": null,
              "imageVersion": null,
              "release": "rayd-v{sdkVersion}",
              "previousBucket": null
            }
          ],
          "cost": [
            "pila de IAM: gratis",
            "imagen: ≈ $0,04 por semana por versión publicada (mínimo una semana)",
            "zip de la imagen en el bucket: céntimos"
          ],
          "result": null,
          "doctor": null,
          "error": {
            "code": "needs_confirmation",
            "message": "preparar la cuenta crea recursos con coste: confírmalo con --yes (o desde una terminal)"
          },
          "exitCode": 2
        },
        "stderr": "rayito: preparar la cuenta crea recursos con coste: confírmalo con --yes (o desde una terminal)\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "sin bucket",
      "args": [
        "setup",
        "--dry-run"
      ],
      "input": {
        "region": "us-east-1",
        "account": "123456789012",
        "bucket": null,
        "environmentBucket": null,
        "artifact": null,
        "stack": null,
        "buckets": {},
        "image": null
      },
      "expected": {
        "exitCode": 2,
        "stdout": "",
        "stderr": "rayito: no hay bucket para el artefacto de la imagen: pasa --bucket, exporta RAYITO_BUCKET o ejecuta `cdk bootstrap` en esta cuenta y región; Rayito no crea buckets\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "región sin Lambda MicroVMs",
      "args": [
        "setup",
        "--dry-run"
      ],
      "input": {
        "region": "sa-east-1",
        "account": "123456789012",
        "bucket": null,
        "environmentBucket": null,
        "artifact": null,
        "stack": null,
        "buckets": {},
        "image": null
      },
      "expected": {
        "exitCode": 2,
        "stdout": "",
        "stderr": "rayito: la región sa-east-1 no tiene Lambda MicroVMs: usa una de us-east-1, us-east-2, us-west-2, eu-west-1, ap-northeast-1, ap-south-1, ap-southeast-1, ap-southeast-2, eu-central-1, eu-north-1\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "pila bloqueada",
      "args": [
        "setup",
        "--dry-run"
      ],
      "input": {
        "region": "us-east-1",
        "account": "123456789012",
        "bucket": null,
        "environmentBucket": null,
        "artifact": null,
        "stack": {
          "status": "ROLLBACK_COMPLETE",
          "outputs": {},
          "parameters": {
            "ArtifactBucket": "amzn-s3-demo-bucket"
          }
        },
        "buckets": {
          "amzn-s3-demo-bucket": "us-east-1"
        },
        "image": null
      },
      "expected": {
        "exitCode": 1,
        "stdout": "",
        "stderr": "rayito: la pila rayito-m0-iam está en ROLLBACK_COMPLETE: bórrala (aws cloudformation delete-stack --stack-name rayito-m0-iam), espera a que desaparezca y vuelve a ejecutar `rayito setup`\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "bucket de otra región",
      "args": [
        "setup",
        "--dry-run",
        "--bucket",
        "amzn-s3-demo-bucket"
      ],
      "input": {
        "region": "us-east-1",
        "account": "123456789012",
        "bucket": "amzn-s3-demo-bucket",
        "environmentBucket": null,
        "artifact": null,
        "stack": null,
        "buckets": {
          "amzn-s3-demo-bucket": "eu-west-1"
        },
        "image": null
      },
      "expected": {
        "exitCode": 2,
        "stdout": "",
        "stderr": "rayito: el bucket amzn-s3-demo-bucket está en eu-west-1, no en us-east-1: el build fallaría con S3_CROSS_REGION_ACCESS_DENIED\n"
      }
    }
  ]
}
